      "text": "TIMELINE DISPLAY (Shows all 8 phases as they execute):\n\n✓ Phase 1: EMBED (10ms)\n✓ Phase 2: PARSE (5ms)\n⏳ Phase 3: THEORY (80ms) [Docling chunks retrieved]\n⏳ Phase 4: ROUTE (1ms)\n⏳ Phase 5: RETRIEVE (150ms) [Blended search]\n⏳ Phase 6: BLEND (20ms)\n⏳ Phase 7: VISUALIZE (50ms)\n⏳ Phase 8: GENERATE (800ms) [DSPy]\n⏳ QUALITY CHECK (200ms) [DeepEval]\n\nReal-time progress updates via WebSocket",
