      "x": 70,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "DISPLAYS:\n\n1. SCOUTING BRIEF (DSPy output)\n   \"João shows improvement (+8% momentum)...\"\n\n2. TOP 3 CANDIDATES\n   João Palhinha (0.73)\n   Alexis Mac Allister (0.715)\n   Sander Berge (0.665)\n\n3. IMPACT ANALYSIS\n   Why João #1:\n   • Momentum: +8% (improving)\n   • Press: 78% (>75% required)\n   • Notes: Below creative threshold\n\n4. SCATTER PLOT\n   2D visualization (PCA projection)\n   Query point + candidate points\n\n5. QUALITY SCORES (DeepEval)\n   Faithfulness: 0.94\n   Relevancy: 0.91\n   Contextual: 0.96",
