    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "legend_content",
      "x": 59.71636606930997,
      "y": 824.905657776024,
      "width": 585.1998291015625,
      "height": 168.75,
      "text": "🖥️ FRONTEND (React):  User types query → Submits → Receives response → Displays results\n\n⚙️ BACKEND (FastAPI): 8 phases execute sequentially → Tools process data → Quality gates validate → Response sent back\n\n🟠 TOOLS INVOLVED:\n  • Phase 3: Docling-parsed theory chunks retrieved from Index A\n  • Phase 8: DSPy generates brief (grounded by metrics_checklist constraint)\n  • Quality Gate: DeepEval validates (Faithfulness, Relevancy, Contextual Relevancy)\n\n📦 DATA STORAGE:\n  • Milvus Index A: Theory (from Docling parsing of books)\n  • Milvus Index B: Blended player data (season + career in one document)\n  • CSVs: Reference data (managers, wages, etc.)\n\n",
      "fontSize": 9,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 0,
      "version": 19,
      "versionNonce": 1832066598,
      "index": "an",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "seed": 1,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780591684033,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🖥️ FRONTEND (React):  User types query → Submits → Receives response → Displays results\n\n⚙️ BACKEND (FastAPI): 8 phases execute sequentially → Tools process data → Quality gates validate → Response sent back\n\n🟠 TOOLS INVOLVED:\n  • Phase 3: Docling-parsed theory chunks retrieved from Index A\n  • Phase 8: DSPy generates brief (grounded by metrics_checklist constraint)\n  • Quality Gate: DeepEval validates (Faithfulness, Relevancy, Contextual Relevancy)\n\n📦 DATA STORAGE:\n  • Milvus Index A: Theory (from Docling parsing of books)\n  • Milvus Index B: Blended player data (season + career in one document)\n  • CSVs: Reference data (managers, wages, etc.)\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "2DIAVhgNMCbcSq2paMh5W",
      "x": 1003.6308404753554,
      "y": 347.3246377622406,
      "width": 189.31554670721727,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "QUALITY GATE [DEEPEVAL VALIDATION]\n\n🔵 3 Metrics checked:\n  • Faithfulness (0.94): Only cite context?\n✓\n  • Relevancy (0.91): Answer query? ✓\n  • Contextual (0.96): Facts relevant? ✓\n  \nAll > 0.85? → PASS → Send to frontend\nAny fail? → REGENERATE with DSPy",
      "fontSize": 8,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
